SELF-DETECTED ISSUES AND FIXES DURING THIS RUN
  1. validate_config() originally rejected any run below 100000 bookings, which made
     smoke testing impossible. Fixed with an explicit --smoke flag.
  2. choose_day() originally rebuilt the day-weight vector on every booking draw.
     Fixed with a precomputed cumulative table and bisect lookup.
  3. The initial 3-academic-year calendar failed G2 because summer breaks shortened
     the day span. Fixed by extending config.example.json to four academic years.
  4. load.sql originally mixed a T-SQL variable with sqlcmd substitution. Fixed by
     using a single sqlcmd variable guard.
  5. Advisory acknowledgements were originally emitted for soft-deleted confirmed
     bookings. Fixed by skipping deleted bookings in the ack loop, then regenerating
     the dataset and rerunning live load/verify.

